@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Cierre 2: GET /api/v1/logistics/closings/:transportOrderId (Detalle 1 a 1 de Cierre de OT)

actor "Liquidador / Auditor / Administrador" as User
participant "App Web (Frontend)" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Closing Detail Service" as Service
participant "transport_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "warehouse_closings DB\n(transport_order_warehouse_closings)" as WhClosingDB
participant "sales_items & products DB\n(transport_order_sales_items / products)" as SalesItemsDB
participant "collection_closings DB\n(transport_order_collection_closings)" as CollClosingDB
participant "payment_references DB\n(delivery_payment_references)" as PaymentsDB

User -> Web: Selecciona una Orden de Transporte (ej: 525420010)
Web -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/logistics/closings/525420010
Gateway -> Service: getClosingDetail(transportOrderId: 525420010)

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findOrderHeaderWithTruckAndRoute(525420010)
OrdersDB --> Service: orderHeader (OT, Chofer, CI, Empresa, Placa, Tipo Camión, Ruta)

Service -> WhClosingDB: 2. findWarehouseClosingByOrderId(525420010)
WhClosingDB --> Service: whClosing (status, total_dispatch_qty, total_returned_qty, driver & wh signatures)

Service -> SalesItemsDB: 3. findProductReconciliationItems(525420010)
SalesItemsDB --> Service: productItems[] (50 SKUs: Despacho, Facturado, Bonif, Devuelto, Faltante, Sobrante, Valores en Bs)

Service -> CollClosingDB: 4. findCollectionClosingByOrderId(525420010)
CollClosingDB --> Service: collClosing (status, cash_amount, total_to_render, cash_bob_breakdown, 4 signatures)

Service -> PaymentsDB: 5. findPaymentReferencesAndCredits(525420010)
PaymentsDB --> Service: paymentRefs[] (Transferencias bancarias, Cobros QR, Cheques, Créditos autorizados, Devoluciones)

Service -> Service: 6. buildClosingDetailResponse(orderHeader, whClosing, productItems, collClosing, paymentRefs)
note right of Service
  Lógica en Memoria:
  - Estructura Tab 1 (Almacén): Banners (Bs / unidades) + Tabla 14 Cols + Firmas
  - Estructura Tab 2 (Cobranzas): 3 Cajas + Arqueo Cortes + Transf/QR/Créditos + 4 Firmas
  - Estructura Tab 3 (Balance): Matriz de Concordancia Operativa-Financiera (Diferencia = Bs 0.00)
end note

Service --> Gateway: closingDetailResponse
Gateway --> Web: 200 OK (Detalle 1 a 1 de Cierre)
Web --> User: Renderiza Ficha Operativa y contenido de las 3 pestañas
@enduml
